    <div class="viz-label">Step 2 · <code>nums1 = [1,2,2,1]</code> → sorted <code>[1,1,2,2]</code> · <code>nums2 = [2,2]</code> · match at 2</div>
    <div class="viz wrap">
      <div class="col"><div class="pslot"></div><div class="cell done">1</div><div class="idx">0</div></div>
