  <div class="callout" style="border-left-color:var(--indigo);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f5f3ff 0%,#eef2ff 100%);border-color:#c7d2fe;">
    <div class="ctitle" style="color:var(--indigo)">📐 New Primitives Per Volume</div>
    <p><b>V2 (Sorted Arrays, Ranges, Matrices):</b> Midpoint Calculation · Range Halving · Interval Overlap Test · Sweep Events · 2D Index Mapping · Layer Boundary Shrinking.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px;"><b>V3 (Hash / Stack / Deque / Heap):</b> Hash Insert/Lookup/Delete · Stack Push/Pop · Deque Push/Pop Both Ends · Heap Push/Pop with Priority.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px;"><b>V4 (Nodes &amp; Range Trees):</b> Node Traversal · Recursive Descent · Traversal Orders · Lowbit Update/Query · Segment Node Merge.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px;"><b>V5 (Graphs):</b> Adjacency List Construction · Visited-Set Discipline · Union-Find · Priority-Queue Relaxation.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px;"><b>V6 (DP):</b> Recurrence + Base Case · Memoization Cache · Tabulation Table · Space-Optimization Reduction.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px;"><b>V7 (Recursion / D&amp;C / Greedy / Bits / Math):</b> Choose-Explore-Unchoose · Split-Solve-Combine · Greedy Local Choice + Invariant · Bit Operations · Modular Arithmetic · GCD Loop · Sieve Marking.</p>
  </div>

